============================================================================================
HYP-3530 LRC(14): multi-denominator rho_D and k<12 attacker floor
============================================================================================
All displayed exact quantities are Fraction arithmetic; decimals are only annotations.
rho_D is a finite denominator witness/opportunity density, not a completed
reconstructed-cover proof.  The global-witness threshold is theta=1/7.
============================================================================================
A. Multi-denominator finite witness criterion max_D rho_D
============================================================================================
D-bank: all denominators 2..196.  D<=14 and 14m subfamilies are tracked.
Strict inequalities are used at grid points: safe means ||p*a/D|| >= 1/14,
and good means maxgap > theta.

