============================================================================================
B. k<12 union-bound floor: exact bounded-core attacker scan
============================================================================================
Attacker definition: normalized E with mu_1/7(E) < thr_k = 1 - gp_min(k).
Exact bounded bank: all primitive normalized shapes with span <= k+5.
Large-spread probe: exact mu on tail and random sparse shapes outside the bank.

  k=8  |P|=5  gp_min=2243/5880 = 0.38146259 at P=(1, 5, 7, 8, 9)
    thr_k=3637/5880 = 0.61853741
    exact bank span<= 13: primitive_shapes=1716
    min mu_1/7 found=691/735 = 0.94013605
    consecutive mu=691/735 = 0.94013605; min==consec? True
    bounded attackers=0; below-consec shapes=0; near-attackers(mu<thr+1/20)=0
    bounded union floor found=1891/5880 = 0.32159864
    minimizer sample=[(0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7)]
